 # Changelog
 
+## 1.0.0-beta.7 - 2026-10-26
+
+- Stick actions: `registerStickAction(id, label, colors)` registers an action that is an analog
+  stick. In the editor a button whose action is cycled (`ACTION`) to a stick action becomes a stick
+  with that label and color; cycling on turns it back into a button. A layout keeps at most two
+  sticks and 16 buttons; `ACTION` skips what would break that.
+- Such sticks report through the new optional `RetroTouchStickListener.onStick(actionId, x, y)`
+  (-1..1, y down, 0/0 when released) that the listener implements next to `RetroTouchListener`;
+  the move stick keeps reporting through `onMove`. `isStickAction(id)` tells the kind.
+- A stick shows its label (one letter on the knob); the move stick still shows `MOVE`.
+- All beta.6 classes and methods remain and the saved-layout format is unchanged (format 2),
+  allowing an AAR-only update.
+
 ## 1.0.0-beta.6 - 2026-10-19
 
 - Button labels with exactly one character, such as `A`, `B`, `X`, `Y`, `Z`, `L` or `R`, are drawn
